Sac for Magicbane & use it; until then Elbereth takes to long to engrave
in an emergency situation, and writing in the dust is too prone to
spelling mistakes & erodes too fast to be reliable.

> Any suggestions/ideas?
> 

Take it slow, stay in the top 3-5 levels until XPLv 3-5.  Kill at range
w/ spells, falling back on thrown daggers, and in the immortal words of
King Arthur, "Run Away, Run Away!".  And remember, low level Wizards are
crappy, dying is common; don't get too discouraged by it.  And it's a
game, so

